     <td style="padding-top:0in;text-indent:7.2pt;padding-left:0in;vertical-align:top;padding-bottom:0in;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #95b3d7;padding-right:0in;"><p style="margin-left:1.333%;text-indent:0;font-size:9pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Based solely on a Schedule 13D/A filed with the SEC on December 8, 2025, Irrevocable Larson Family Investment Trust has sole voting power and disposition power with respect to 2,350,000 shares.</span></p></td>
     <td style="padding-top:0in;border-right:0.5pt solid #95b3d7;text-indent:7.2pt;padding-left:0in;vertical-align:top;padding-bottom:0in;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #95b3d7;padding-right:0in;"><p style="margin-left:1.333%;text-indent:0;font-size:9pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><span style="white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">&#160;</span></p></td>
